    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats of Atlantis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mysterious journey to Atlantis, searching for playful cats among crystal palaces, underwater temples, and bustling coral markets. Can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:<br>\u2022 Over 100 unique hidden cats waiting to be discovered<br>\u2022 Beautifully hand-drawn Atlantean scenes, from underwater gardens to ancient ruins<br>\u2022 Relaxing soundtrack inspired by deep-sea music<br>\u2022 Perfect for short breaks - find a few cats at a time, save your progress, and return anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from daily life with this casual hidden object game. Each cat has its unique personality and hiding style, bringing surprises with every discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Base game includes one complete level.</p>",
